## Model card

- **Name:** ERNIE 5.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Baidu ERNIE-family flash model as represented in local metadata (280B/14B sparse MoE, 1M context, high-throughput text/code focus), but independently verifiable public benchmark evidence for this exact non-preview identity was not found in this pass.
- **Provider / access:** Local metadata lists `baidu/ernie-5.5-flash` and Baidu Qianfan/Wenxin Workshop context; no independently verified stable public model card/API listing for this exact ID was confirmed in accessible sources.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established for the exact `ernie-5.5-flash` identity. Closest official public release found was **ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview** (2026-11-11, ernie.baidu.com), which may differ from this folder’s identity.
- **IDs:** `ernie-5.5-flash`, `baidu/ernie-5.5-flash` (local).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total / 131,072 max output claimed in local metadata; ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview page states 1M-token context for that preview model.
- **Modalities:** Text in/out per local metadata (text/code-focused). Preview materials emphasize coding/3D modeling/knowledge work/content creation tasks.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** Local metadata cites ~2–8 CNY/1M (~$0.28/$1.13) on Baidu Qianfan (with off-peak/promotional tier). Exact current pricing for this exact non-preview identity was not independently verified.
- **Architecture:** Local metadata describes 280B-total / 14B-active sparse MoE with HCA and MLA-DSA attention; ERNIE 5.5 Flash Preview page states 280B total / 14B active. Architecture details not fully independently verified for this exact ID.

